{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/t8jql03e","slide":3,"text":"Developers often switch between operating system tools, network calculators, API clients, website auditors, and music applications.","textPreview":"Developers often switch between operating system tools, network calculators, API clients, website auditors, and music applications.","textChars":131,"textLines":1,"bbox":[72,168,470,150]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/u9cru5kz","slide":3,"text":"DevPulse brings these tasks into one controlled browser workspace. The application emphasizes bounded tests, clear ownership checks, and results that are easy to demonstrate.","textPreview":"DevPulse brings these tasks into one controlled browser workspace. The application emphasizes bounded tests, clear ownership checks, and ...","textChars":174,"textLines":1,"bbox":[72,345,470,160]}
